<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="The Magazine — a periodic selection from Backyard Magazine."
  >
  <title>The Magazine — Issue No. 01 | Backyard</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="addons.css">

  <style>
    /*
      The page deliberately reuses Backyard's existing design tokens:
      --ink, --ink-muted, --ink-faint, --paper, and its loaded fonts.
      These rules only compose a magazine layout around the established
      BACKYARD header and visual language.
    */

    .magazine-page {
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 2rem 6rem;
    }

    .magazine-masthead {
      padding: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem) 0 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink, #1a1a18);
    }

    .magazine-kicker,
    .magazine-section-label,
    .magazine-issue-number,
    .magazine-card-source,
    .magazine-card-index {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      line-height: 1.25;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .magazine-kicker {
      margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
    }

    .magazine-title {
      max-width: 15ch;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink, #1a1a18);
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 10rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.075em;
      line-height: 0.78;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .magazine-subtitle {
      max-width: 40rem;
      margin: 2.1rem 0 0;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.35rem);
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .magazine-issue-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      padding-top: 0.9rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--ink, #1a1a18);
    }

    .magazine-introduction {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 2fr);
      gap: 2rem;
      padding: 3.5rem 0 4rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink, #1a1a18);
    }

    .magazine-introduction p {
      max-width: 42rem;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.1vw, 1.8rem);
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .magazine-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1px;
      margin-top: 4rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--ink, #1a1a18);
      background: var(--ink, #1a1a18);
    }

    .magazine-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: 28rem;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      background: var(--paper, #ffffff);
      color: var(--ink, #1a1a18);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background-color 160ms ease, color 160ms ease;
    }

    .magazine-card:hover,
    .magazine-card:focus-visible {
      background: var(--ink, #1a1a18);
      color: var(--ink-faint, #ffffff);
      outline: none;
    }

    .magazine-card-primary {
      grid-column: span 6;
    }

    .magazine-card-secondary {
      grid-column: span 3;
    }

    .magazine-card-topline {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .magazine-card-title {
      max-width: 12ch;
      margin: auto 0 1rem;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4.5rem);
      font-weight: 750;
      letter-spacing: -0.055em;
      line-height: 0.9;
    }

    .magazine-card-secondary .magazine-card-title {
      max-width: 10ch;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.8vw, 3rem);
    }

    .magazine-card-excerpt {
      max-width: 31rem;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .magazine-card-cta {
      margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .magazine-closing {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 2fr);
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-top: 4rem;
      padding: 1.5rem 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--ink, #1a1a18);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink, #1a1a18);
    }

    .magazine-closing p {
      max-width: 38rem;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .magazine-page {
        padding-right: 1rem;
        padding-left: 1rem;
      }

      .magazine-introduction,
      .magazine-closing {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .magazine-card-primary,
      .magazine-card-secondary {
        grid-column: span 12;
        min-height: 22rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div include-html="header.html"></div>

  <main id="main-content" class="magazine-page">
    <header class="magazine-masthead">
      <p class="magazine-kicker">Backyard Magazine presents</p>
      <h1 class="magazine-title">The<br>Magazine</h1>
      <p class="magazine-subtitle">
        A periodic selection of stories, inquiries, and sounds from across
        Heralding Time, Last Scattering Surface, and Space of Sound.
      </p>

      <div class="magazine-issue-row" aria-label="Issue information">
        <p class="magazine-issue-number">Issue No. 01</p>
        <p class="magazine-issue-number">September 2026</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="magazine-introduction" aria-labelledby="letter-from-backyard">
      <p id="letter-from-backyard" class="magazine-section-label">From Backyard</p>
      <p>
        The first issue gathers three different ways of looking outward:
        the measured motion of our planet, the long life of a star, and the
        temporal orbit of music. Read them slowly, follow the paths they
        open, and return to their original publications for the full archive.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="magazine-grid" aria-label="Issue No. 01 selections">
      <a class="magazine-card magazine-card-primary" href="ht.html">
        <div class="magazine-card-topline">
          <p class="magazine-card-source">Heralding Time</p>
          <p class="magazine-card-index">01</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="magazine-card-title">tune the orchestra</h2>

        <p class="magazine-card-excerpt">
          On the motion of the Earth — chapter IX.
        </p>

        <p class="magazine-card-cta">Read in Heralding Time →</p>
      </a>

      <a class="magazine-card magazine-card-secondary" href="lss.html">
        <div class="magazine-card-topline">
          <p class="magazine-card-source">Last Scattering Surface</p>
          <p class="magazine-card-index">02</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="magazine-card-title">A story of a star — Part V</h2>

        <p class="magazine-card-excerpt">
          Burning, aging, and the inevitable consequence of a star's journey.
        </p>

        <p class="magazine-card-cta">Read in LSS →</p>
      </a>

      <a class="magazine-card magazine-card-secondary" href="sp.html">
        <div class="magazine-card-topline">
          <p class="magazine-card-source">Space of Sound</p>
          <p class="magazine-card-index">03</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="magazine-card-title">sound orbits #8</h2>

        <p class="magazine-card-excerpt">
          This week in music: Sun 01 March — Sat 14 Mar.
        </p>

        <p class="magazine-card-cta">Read in Space of Sound →</p>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="magazine-closing" aria-labelledby="continue-reading">
      <p id="continue-reading" class="magazine-section-label">Continue reading</p>
      <p>
        The Magazine is an edited path through Backyard, not a replacement
        for its three publications. Browse the complete archives of
        <a href="ht.html">Heralding Time</a>,
        <a href="lss.html">Last Scattering Surface</a>, and
        <a href="sp.html">Space of Sound</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div include-html="footer.html"></div>

  <script src="includeHTML.js"></script>
  <script>
    includeHTML();
  </script>
  <script src="layout.js"></script>
  <script src="headerScrollState.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
